      "tips": [
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:0",
          "text": "Cast Double Daggers on the enemy to leave Feathers behind them, then use Bladecaller to pull the Feathers back through them.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-Q", "start": 5, "end": 19 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-E", "start": 73, "end": 84 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.16
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:1",
          "text": "Bladecaller needs a Feather on the ground. Place Feathers before you cast it, because it can't be cast without one.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-E", "start": 0, "end": 11 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.16
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:2",
          "text": "Try to get the enemy rooted with Bladecaller by hitting them with several Feathers. Then your team can attack them freely.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "rooted", "start": 21, "end": 27 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-E", "start": 33, "end": 44 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.2
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:3",
          "text": "Use abilities between basic attacks. Each cast powers up your next attacks with Clean Cuts, so they hit everything in a line and leave more Feathers.",
          "refs": [
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Xayah-passive",
              "start": 80,
              "end": 90
            }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.3
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:4",
          "text": "Turn on Deadly Plumage when a trade or fight starts. It gives you Attack Speed, and hitting a champion gives you Move Speed.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-W", "start": 8, "end": 22 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.02
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:5",
          "text": "Use Featherstorm to dodge a key enemy ability. You can't be targeted while in the air, and it leaves a line of Feathers.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-R", "start": 4, "end": 16 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.13
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:6",
          "text": "You can't attack or cast abilities during Featherstorm, so don't use it just to deal damage when you could be hit afterward.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-R", "start": 42, "end": 54 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.27
        },
        {
          "id": "adc:Xayah:general:7",
          "text": "Double Daggers hits harder against the first target it reaches. Aim it so the first thing hit is the enemy champion, not a minion.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Xayah-Q", "start": 0, "end": 14 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.03
        }
      ],
      "combos": []
    }
  ],
